- take responsibility for everything that happens under your account; and
- not access the Service through bots, scripts or other automated means, except through an interface we have expressly provided.

If information you give us is false or out of date, we may suspend or close your account. We may also change or reclaim a username that we reasonably consider inappropriate or misleading.

